    "/objects/{objectId}/transition" : {
      "post" : {
        "tags" : [ "objects" ],
        "summary" : "Move an object through its Workflow",
        "operationId" : "postObjectsByObjectIdTransition",
        "description" : "Body `{action}` (a Workflow action, e.g. `accept`, `resolve`, `archive`, `reopen`) or `{status}` / `{to}` (a target state); one of them is required (else 400). `disposition` rides only a move that DECIDES an Incident — `RESOLVED`, or any terminal state of its Workflow except `ARCHIVED` — where it is REQUIRED (a value of the Disposition ladder, else 422); on any other move it is 422. Moving an Incident out of RESOLVED/ARCHIVED back to a working state (reopen) clears the recorded disposition.",
